          "Every adult display creative has a half-life. Users in entertainment browsing contexts consume repetitive visuals quickly; what felt novel on Monday becomes invisible by Thursday. For iGaming operators in Türkiye, ad fatigue manifests as rising CPC, flat or falling click-to-registration rate, and eventually declining FTD efficiency—even when landing pages remain unchanged. Managing refresh cadence is a core deliverable in Jelibon’s adult tube and high-intent display advertising service.",
